<title>USA: Gallery of History Inc Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Gallery of History Inc Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>GALLERY OF HISTORY INC.</p>
<p>				Financial Highlights</p>
<p>							Third quarter ended</p>
<p>								June 30,</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues					  $670,944    $813,773</p>
<p> Net income (loss) after taxes (a)(b)    (49,487)     203,193</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share		    (2 cts)	 3 cts</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding		 3,255,352   5,917,654</p>
<p>						  Nine-month period ended</p>
<p>								June 30,</p>
<p>							  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues					 2,442,715   1,723,177</p>
<p> Net income after taxes (a)(b)		647,575	26,292</p>
<p> Earnings per share				19 cts	    --</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding		 3,354,499   5,917,654</p>
<p>NOTE: (a)  In October 1996, the company repurchased 2,659,720 shares of its common stock for total consideration of $2 million, consisting of 460 documents valued at $1,803,045 and $196,955 in cash.  The book value of the inventory was $1,446,492, resulting in a gain on disposition of $356,553, or 11 cents per share, which is included in the first quarter's net income.</p>
<p>(b)  Includes a one-time restructuring charge of $217,438, in the quarter and nine months relating to the company's shift from retail to auction sales.</p>
